{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_handoff_74__7e123336_handoff_74", "label": "HANDOFF-74 \u2014 chat 121 to chat 122", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-74__7e123336.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Live files are BUILD90 main and BUILD150 compendia; \u00a732.1 is closed at 76.1 % of the main volume read, and chat 122 seats nothing at open and writes W-161 at close."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_74__7e123336_chat_121_unit_l8889_l9029", "label": "Chat 121 unit L8889\u2013L9029 (\u00a732.1.2 through \u00a732.1.4.1), \u00a732.1 closed", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-74__7e123336.md", "source_location": "L13", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_74__7e123336_enlargement_table", "label": "The enlargement table's five rows \u2014 976 / 8,853 / 89,438 / 267,858 / 499,246", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-74__7e123336.md", "source_location": "L40", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "|R(\u039b)| = |\u039b| and E = 0 measured at the first three; the last two are bounded by a stated 4,000,000-cell ambient-box budget, which is a budget bound and not a negative."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_74__7e123336_ambient_box_budget_rule", "label": "State a budget rather than a negative when a computation is too large", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-74__7e123336.md", "source_location": "L40", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_74__7e123336_s3_baseline_25_vs_36", "label": "\u00a732.2's S3 baseline computed over 25 chapters where the volume carries 36", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-74__7e123336.md", "source_location": "L30", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The true multiple is 9.53x, so the printed 6.5x is an understatement: every figure a section computes about the BOOK must be re-measured against the book as it now stands."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_74__7e123336_grouped_register_heading_commas", "label": "Match a grouped Register heading on commas as well as dashes", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-74__7e123336.md", "source_location": "L60", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The Register's seven grouped headings are comma-lists, and a dash-range pattern sees none of them."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_74__7e123336_register_1660_entries", "label": "The Register at 1,628 bare + 7 grouped = 1,660 distinct entry numbers", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-74__7e123336.md", "source_location": "L54", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_74__7e123336_prints_and_proofs_offset", "label": "One global Prints & Proofs offset holds across a unit but must be re-anchored per witness", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-74__7e123336.md", "source_location": "L70", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chat 121 measured -94 at ten witnesses where chat 120 measured -88 and -94 inside a single 99-line unit, so every PP witness is anchored on its own text."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_74__7e123336_pointer_site_regex", "label": "A pointer-site regex must be \u00a7N(?!\\d)(?!\\.\\d), and a lettered pointer needs its own pattern", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-74__7e123336.md", "source_location": "L82", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_74__7e123336_withdr_stem", "label": "`withdraw` is not the stem \u2014 use `withdr`, and sweep `retract` and `supersed` alongside", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-74__7e123336.md", "source_location": "L92", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_74__7e123336_ell_tuple_index", "label": "The \u2113 coordinate is tuple index 1, not 2 \u2014 index 2 is n\u2032", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-74__7e123336.md", "source_location": "L95", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_74__7e123336_probe_scoring_zero_is_broken", "label": "A probe that scores zero on its own volume is broken, not a finding", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-74__7e123336.md", "source_location": "L57", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "And the two-line join must normalise whitespace, because body lines carry a leading space and `line + ' ' + next` produces a double space that hides a witness spanning the wrap."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_74__7e123336_chat_95_ruling_finding_not_question", "label": "The chat-95 ruling \u2014 a finding is not a question", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-74__7e123336.md", "source_location": "L8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A deviation in the mathematics or in the prose is recorded and flagged for repair, never put to M, and Prints & Proofs is read before any question is asked."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_74__7e123336_chat_81_cadence", "label": "The chat-81 cadence \u2014 read, census in two kinds, exactly two instrument batches, never split a section read", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-74__7e123336.md", "source_location": "L10", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_74__7e123336_r2_ch16o", "label": "r2-ch16o \u2014 chat 122's compu